 familiar names."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"head","label":"Head","startLine":14336,"endLine":14342,"text":"Heavy frontal headache. Sore, tired feel-\ning; bruised feeling of scalp. Pain over right eye ex-\ntending back through the head. Bilious headache ;\ncoated tongue, bad taste, constipation. Vertigo, obscure\nvision and gastric derangement, associated with albu-\nminuria."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"stomach","label":"Stomach","startLine":14343,"endLine":14345,"text":"Mouth dry, pasty taste ; thirsty, stomach\nfull and uncomfortable."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"abdomen","label":"Abdomen","startLine":14346,"endLine":14350,"text":"Flatus and pain. Anus very sore and\nburning. Constipation with hiemorrhoids and severe\nbackache. Diarrhoea; stools variable and profuse,\nbloody. Pain about umbilical region."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"urinary","label":"Urinary","startLine":14351,"endLine":14355,"text":"Urine scanty, high-colored; acidity in-\nojKf^sed, poured out rapidly.\n\nKUOXVMUS ATROP. — EUPAT. AROMI — EUPAT. PER. 319"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"back","label":"Back","startLine":14356,"endLine":14359,"text":"Dull pain between shoulders and about renal\nand splenic region; pain in lumbar region better lying\ndown."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":14360,"endLine":14362,"text":"Aching in all joints, especially ankles.\nFeet feel swollen and tired."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"modalities","label":"Modalities","startLine":14363,"endLine":14365,"text":"Better cool draught, pressure. Worse\nevening."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":14366,"endLine":14371,"text":"Euonymus ILuropcca — Spiiidle-trec\n(Liver disorders, biliousness, lumbago, gastric derange-\nments with albuminuria. Cutting pains in malar bones,\ntongue, penis up to bladder); Podophyl; Ammon, pic.;\nChcl.; Euonymin ix trit. (albuminuria)."}],"corpusPassages":[]}